{
  "slug": "production-grade",
  "name": "Production Grade",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "14 skills for all software engineering work. Not just greenfield builds.\n\nBuild a complete SaaS from scratch, add a feature to existing code, harden before launch, set up CI/CD, write tests, review code quality — the orchestrator routes to the right skills automatically.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **14 skills** and **2 hooks**.\n\n- **Skills** (14): `code-reviewer` ([production-grade internal] Reviews code for quality — architecture conformance, anti-patterns, performance issues, maintainability), `data-scientist` ([production-grade internal] Optimizes AI/ML/LLM usage when you need model selection, prompt engineering, cost reduction, or experiment design), `devops` ([production-grade internal] Sets up deployment and infrastructure — Docker, CI/CD pipelines, cloud provisioning, environment configuration), `frontend-engineer` ([production-grade internal] Builds web frontends — React/Next.js components, pages, design systems, state management, typed API clients), `polymath` ([production-grade internal] Thinking partner when you're unsure what to build or how — explores ideas, researches options, helps…), `product-manager` ([production-grade internal] Turns product ideas and business goals into formal requirements — BRD, user stories, acceptance criteria, prioritization), `production-grade` (Use when the user wants to build, create, or develop anything — websites, apps, APIs, services, platforms), `qa-engineer` ([production-grade internal] Writes and runs tests when you want to verify code works — unit, integration, e2e, performance,…), and 6 more\n- **Hooks** (2): `SessionStart`, `PostToolUse`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install production-grade@claude-community` from `nagisanzenin/claude-code-production-grade-plugin`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
